---

<section id="use-cases" class="py-20 px-6 bg-surface">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto">
    <h2 class="font-display text-white mb-12" style="font-size:clamp(2rem,4vw,3rem)">WHO'S ASKING</h2>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
      <!-- Card 1 -->
      <div class="bg-surfaceHigh border border-muted/50 p-6 hover:border-accent transition-colors duration-200">
        <span class="font-display text-xs px-2 py-0.5 bg-accent text-black inline-block mb-4">PERSONAL</span>
        <h3 class="font-display text-white text-[1.5rem] mb-3">BEFORE THE DATE</h3>
        <p class="font-body text-textSecondary text-sm leading-relaxed">
          You matched on Hinge. They seem normal. But do they follow 12 accounts that post Great Replacement content? Know before you meet.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 2 -->
      <div class="bg-surfaceHigh border border-muted/50 p-6 hover:border-accent transition-colors duration-200">
        <span class="font-display text-xs px-2 py-0.5 bg-muted text-white inline-block mb-4">PROFESSIONAL</span>
        <h3 class="font-display text-white text-[1.5rem] mb-3">BEFORE YOU HIRE</h3>
        <p class="font-body text-textSecondary text-sm leading-relaxed">
          HR teams already Google candidates. Now they can check if the new hire's feed is a red flag factory. Two minutes, no guesswork.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 3 -->
      <div class="bg-surfaceHigh border border-muted/50 p-6 hover:border-accent transition-colors duration-200">
        <span class="font-display text-xs px-2 py-0.5 bg-accentRed text-black inline-block mb-4">PUBLIC FIGURES</span>
        <h3 class="font-display text-white text-[1.5rem] mb-3">BEFORE YOU TRUST THEM</h3>
        <p class="font-body text-textSecondary text-sm leading-relaxed">
          That local politician. That podcaster. That influencer asking for your trust. See exactly who they platform and amplify.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 4 -->
      <div class="bg-surfaceHigh border border-muted/50 p-6 hover:border-accent transition-colors duration-200">
        <span class="font-display text-xs px-2 py-0.5 bg-accentOrange text-black inline-block mb-4">AWKWARD</span>
        <h3 class="font-display text-white text-[1.5rem] mb-3">THE COWORKER SITUATION</h3>
        <p class="font-body text-textSecondary text-sm leading-relaxed">
          You work together. You can't just ask. But you can check if they follow the same accounts as the guy who got fired for the Slack incident.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
